{
  "_doc": "NJC19 (Lim et al., Sci Data 7:204, 2020; Dryad doi:10.5061/dryad.dr7sqv9v8, CC0-1.0): the curated transport network. 9,136 rows of Online-only Table 5 become CONSUMES, DEGRADES and NO_EXCHANGE_WITH, plus export events written into the PRODUCES table HMDB declared. CONSUMES is the edge D6's Metabolite Exchange Score MES = 2PC/(P+C) is identically zero without, and the 912 negatives are their own relationship rather than a flag, so no query counts a refutation as an observation by omission. The Metabolite node is declared here as well as in hmdb.json because this source mints nodes for the compounds HMDB has no record of — macromolecules, mostly, which a metabolome database has no reason to hold.",
